KARTE HAIN SHAHADAT KA MASOOM SAFAR DONO.<br>
AHLE SITAM HAI HARJA JAATE HAI JIDHAR DONO.<br>
<br>
<br>
1.WO MOMINA THI LAAYI JO THI YATEEM PARWAR.<br>
MEHMAAN POHNCHAY JAAKAR QATIL KE HII GHAR DONO.....<br>
<br>
2.THAY DONO QAID AISE DEEWAR BEECH MAY THI.<br>
ROOTI THI UDHAR MAADAR ROOTE THAY IDHAR DONO.....<br>
<br>
3.MUSLIM KE LAADLON NE PAAYI HAI YUNN SHAHADAT.<br>
ZAALIM NE SAR HAI KAATEY ZINDA HAI MAGAR DONO.....<br>
<br>
4.DARIYA KA KANARA HAI ZAALIM KI AZIYAT HAI.<br>
YEH AJRE RISALAT HAI HAI KHOON MAY TAR DONO.<br>
<br>
5.MAA BAAP KI DUAYEIN THI SAAT SAAT INKE.<br>
HAIRAAN THAY KOOFEY MAY YUN SHAMS O QAMAR DONO.....<br>
<br>
6.BHAI KA GALA KAATA BHAI KO YUNN DIKHA KAR.<br>
KITNE GHAREEB THAY YE MUSLIM KE PISAR DONO.....<br>
<br>
KARTE HAIN SHAHADAT KA MASOOM SAFAR DONO.<br>
